    {
      "name": "Sorcerer",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/magic/fire/flame-burning-hand-white.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p><strong>She said sorcery is a sword without a hilt. There is no safe way to grasp it.</strong></p><p><em>—Melisandre, A Dance with Dragons</em></p><p>Arcanists given a precious gift of magical prowess, sorcerers can tap into their own inner reserves to provide more Mana for casting.</p><h3>Iconic Sorcerers</h3><ul><li><strong>Yennefer</strong>, <em>The Witcher</em></li><li><strong>Elsa</strong>, <em>Frozen</em></li><li><strong>Ganondorf</strong>, <em>The Legend of Zelda</em></li><li><strong>Storm</strong>, <em>X-Men</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Sorcerer</h3><p>The sorcerer is a squishy blaster focused on Casting Spells for instant burst damage. You should stay in safety to Cast.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Cast<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Backline<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Mage or Occultist<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Presence, Might<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★★☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Arcana, Influence</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Spells</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Mana</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Cast Max</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Glamour, Tap</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Quickening (0 Mana)</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>12</p></td><td><p>5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Spell-Slinger (-1)</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>16</p></td><td><p>6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>20</p></td><td><p>7</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Quickening (1 Mana), Twinned Spell</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>24</p></td><td><p>8</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>28</p></td><td><p>9</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Spell-Slinger (-2)</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>32</p></td><td><p>10</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>36</p></td><td><p>11</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Quickening (2 Mana), Overpowered</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>40</p></td><td><p>12</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "isSpellcaster": true,
        "levelFeatures": [
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Glamour",
            "description": "<p>You can Cast Spells using Influence.</p><p><strong>Spells:</strong> You learn 4 Spells. You learn 1 other Spell every 2 Levels hereafter.</p><p><strong>Mana:</strong> Your Max Mana is equal to (4 × your Level), and your Cast Max for Spells is equal to (2 + your Level).</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 0,
            "spellAmount": 0,
            "skillChoices": []
          },
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Tap",
            "description": "<p>You gain the Vehement Magic Perk (p. 73), and you can spend your HP as Mana, which also reduces your Max HP by the same amount until you Rest. If you die from this reduction, the Cast still resolves and your body is vaporized.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [
              "Compendium.vagabond.perks.Item.UhI94xpNrdCln9jR"
            ],
            "perkAmount": 1,
            "spellAmount": 0,
            "skillChoices": []
          },
          {
            "level": 2,
            "name": "Quickening (0 Mana)",
            "description": "<p>You can skip your Move to Cast a Spell. This Casting has a Cast Max of 0. The Cast Max increases by 1 every 4 Levels hereafter.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 1,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 0,
            "spellAmount": 0,
            "skillChoices": []
          },
          {
            "level": 3,
            "name": "Perk",
            "description": "<p>Choose a new Perk. You must meet the prerequisites to take it, unless the Perk is granted through a Class Feature.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 1,
            "spellAmount": 0,
            "skillChoices": []
          },
          {
            "level": 4,
            "name": "Spell-Slinger (-1)",
            "description": "<p>The damage die of your Spells is one size larger.</p><p>Further, the roll required for you to Crit on Cast Checks and Saves against Casts is reduced by 1, and is reduced by 1 more every 4 Levels hereafter.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 1,
